---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Projects
description: Side projects, experiments and ideas — mostly learning exercises, some in production.
permalink: /projects/
---

<header class="page-intro">
  <div class="meta-mono subhead">
    <span class="bullet">•</span>
    <span>Index / <span aria-current="page">Projects</span></span>
    <span class="count">[{{ collections.projects | length }}]</span>
  </div>
  <h1 class="page-title">Projects</h1>
  <p class="intro-description">Here I have listed some of the side projects I am working on and perhaps some ideas for future projects too. 
  These projects represent what I do to keep learning and improving how I build and ship software</p>
</header>

<section class="projects-list">
  {% for project in collections.projects %}
  <article class="project project-card">
    <div class="project-header">
      <span class="project-status {% if project.data.status != 'active' %}is-muted{% endif %}">
        {% if project.data.status == 'active' %}Active{% elseif project.data.status == 'coming-soon' %}Coming soon!{% elseif project.data.status == 'archived' %}Archived{% elseif project.data.status == 'idea' %}Idea{% else %}{{ project.data.status }}{% endif %}
      </span>
      {% if project.data.links and project.data.links.length %}
      <div class="project-links">
        {% for link in project.data.links %}
          {% set ext = link.external if link.external is defined else (link.url | isExternalUrl) %}
          <a href="{{ link.url }}" class="project-link"{% if ext %} target="_blank" rel="noopener"{% endif %}>{{ link.label or "Link" }}{% if ext %} {% include "icons/external.svg" %}{% endif %}</a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    <h3><a href="{{ project.url }}">{{ project.data.title }}</a></h3>
    <p>{{ project.data.summary or project.templateContent | striptags | truncate(180) }}</p>
    {% if project.data.stack and project.data.stack.length %}
    <ul class="project-stack" aria-label="Technology stack">
      {% for tech in project.data.stack %}
      <li>{{ tech }}</li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    {% endif %}
    <a href="{{ project.url }}" class="read-more">View project {% include "icons/arrow-right.svg" %}</a>
  </article>
  {% endfor %}
</section>
